<!-- ── About + signup ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────── -->
<section class="h-bottom">
	<div class="h-about">
		<p class="eyebrow" style="margin-bottom: 1.25rem;">What is this</p>
		<h2 class="display h-about-h2">Built for<br>the obsessed.</h2>
		<p class="h-about-body">Whether you're preparing for your first backyard ultra or you've already lost count of how many you've run, BACKYARDS exists to help you go further.</p>
		<p class="h-about-body">We're obsessed with what makes certain runners keep going when everyone else has stopped. This is everything we've learned from the best in the sport, built for ourselves first, and now for you.</p>
	</div>

